      "content": "thanks. some of those sound pretty valid, but i've noticed a lot of people in these meetings just dismiss them as \"NIMBYism\" or say they're just trying to stop progress. do you think those objections are mostly just based on people being selfish/stuck in their ways, or is there actual substance to them that isn't just fear of change?",
